# kanso theme for Kakoune
#
# Ported from the fresh-editor palette (palettes/fresh/kanso.json), shared across the justaperlhacker editor themes.
#
# Generated by scripts/gen_themes.py -- do not edit by hand.

# Code
face global value         rgb:b6927b
face global type          rgb:8ea4a2
